る。","nextNodeIds":[210370114]},{"nodeId":210370114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2400,"speakerName":"孫宇","textMapHash":1112444802,"text":"「土」を少し集めてくれないか？","nextNodeIds":[210370115,210370116]},{"nodeId":210370115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1262276146,"text":"問題ないけど…","nextNodeIds":[210370117]},{"nodeId":210370117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2400,"speakerName":"孫宇","textMapHash":799158194,"text":"故郷を離れるときは、何かしら思い出の品が必要だろう？","nextNodeIds":[210370118]},{"nodeId":210370118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2400,"speakerName":"孫宇","textMapHash":1631018290,"text":"璃月の土をひとつまみでも持っていれば、この土地との繋がりを持っていられる気がするんだ。","nextNodeIds":[210370119]},{"nodeId":210370119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2715451730,"text":"なんで自分で行かないの？","nextNodeIds":[210370120]},{"nodeId":210370120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2400,"speakerName":"孫宇","textMapHash":2481720026,"text":"ハハハ…さっきも言っただろう？もし私が辺りを見て回って、故郷の景色に情が湧いてしまったら…","nextNodeIds":[210370121]},{"nodeId":210370121,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2400,"speakerName":"孫宇","textMapHash":1203505426,"text":"せっかく故郷を離れると決意したこの心も、きっと揺らいでしまうだろう。","nextNodeIds":[210370122]},{"nodeId":210370122,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2400,"speakerName":"孫宇","textMapHash":442328674,"text":"だから、土を採ってくる件は頼む、旅人。欲しい土の位置は地図に記しておく。","nextNodeIds":[210370123]},{"nodeId":210370123,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2219246538,"text":"それはなにか特別な場所？","nextNodeIds":[210370124]},{"nodeId":210370124,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2400,"speakerName":"孫宇","textMapHash":2256481570,"text":"コホン…か、かつてはよくそこで、小鳥と一緒に剣の練習をしていた…","nextNodeIds":[210370125]},{"nodeId":210370125,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2400,"speakerName":"孫宇","textMapHash":4029717178,"text":"とにかく！土を採ってくる件は頼むよ、旅人。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":210370116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅